WEBVTT

00:02.000 --> 00:03.320
In the palace

00:03.400 --> 00:05.240
Find a palace maid with good looks

00:05.320 --> 00:06.987
Enfeoff her as Princess Yongxing

00:07.480 --> 00:09.640
Have the lady-in-waiting teach her etiquette quickly

00:09.720 --> 00:10.960
Yes

00:27.000 --> 00:38.440
In the sixteenth year of Longwu, Princess Yongxing departed Dingzhou for East Yan. The Lord of East Yan voiced dissatisfaction that she was not a true imperial princess, granting her only the rank of consort, and wrote to the Xuan Emperor reducing the promised warhorses from ten thousand to one thousand.

